description="3.3 V rail-to-rail opamp, IHP SG13G2 sg13_hv devices.
Complementary input pairs with constant-gm biasing, Monticelli class-AB
output stage, dual Miller compensation, current-mode biasing.
Drive ibias with a reference current INTO the pin (bandgap+R or beta-multiplier).
Definition: opamp_rtr.spice (which includes opamp_rtr_params.spice)."
}
